#. Tag: title
#: man-kig.1.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; is an application for interactive geometry. It is intended to serve "
"two purposes:"
msgstr ""
"&kig; je aplikacija za interaktivnu geometriju. Namijena je da služi za "
"dvije svrhe:"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To allow students to interactively explore mathematical figures and concepts "
"using the computer;"
msgstr ""
"Da dozvoli studentima interaktivno istraživanje matematičkih figura i "
"koncepta uz pomoć kompjutera;"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To serve as a WYSIWYG tool for drawing mathematical figures and including "
"them in other documents."
msgstr ""
"Da služi kao WYSIWYG alatka za crtanje matematičkih figura uključujući i one "
"u drugim dokumentima."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this program you can do geometry on a computer just like you would on a "
"blackboard in a classroom. However the program allows you to move and change "
"parts of a geometrical drawing so that you can see how other parts change as "
"a result."
msgstr ""
"Sa ovim programom možete raditi geometriju na kompjuteru kao što bi na tabli "
"u učionici. Međutim program dozvoljava da pomjerate i mijenjate dijelove "
"geometrijske slike da bi vidjeli kako se drugi dijelovi mijenjaju kao "
"rezultat toga."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kig; supports loci and user-defined macros. It also imports and exports "
"both to and from foreign file formats including <application>Cabri</"
"application>, <application>Dr. Geo</application>, &kgeo;, <application>KSeg</"
"application> and <application>XFig</application>."
msgstr ""
"&kig; podržava loci i korisničke definirane makroe. Također uvozi i izvozi "
"oboje do stranog formata dokumenta uključujući <application>Cabri</"
"application>, <application>Dr. Geo</application>, &kgeo;, <application>KSeg</"
"application> and <application>XFig</application>."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "This application is part of the official &kde; edutainment module."
msgstr "Ova aplikacije je dio od oficijelnog &kde; Edutainment modula."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kig.1.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kig.1.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "-c, --convert-to-native"
msgstr "-c, --convert-to-native"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not show a &GUI;. Instead convert the specified file to native &kig; "
"format. The native &kig; file will be written to standard output unless "
"<option>--outfile</option> is passed."
msgstr ""
"Ne prikazuj &GUI;. Umjesto toga konvertuj specifiran dokument na maternji "
"&kig; format. Maternji &kig; dokument će biti napisan na standardni izlaz "
"osim ako <option>--izlazni dokument</option> je proslijeđen."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kig.1.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "-o, --outfile <replaceable>filename</replaceable>"
msgstr "-o, --outfile <replaceable>Ime dokumenta</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Used with <option>--convert-to-native</option> to specify where to save the "
"newly created &kig; file. Not specifying this option, or providing a "
"filename of <filename>-</filename> will output the file to standard output."
msgstr ""
"Korišteno s <option>--convert-to-native</option> da bi specifirali gdje "
"želite da snimite novokreirani &kig; dokument. Bez specifiranja ove opcije, "
"ili davanja ime dokumenta <filename>-</filename> će dati standardni izlaz."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kig.1.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "Pogledaj i"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink url=\"help:/kig"
"\">help:/kig</ulink> (either enter this <acronym>URL</acronym> into "
"&konqueror;, or run <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kig</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"Detaljnija korisnička dokumentacija dostupna je od <ulink url = \"help: / KIG"
"\"> help: / KIG </ulink> (unesite ovaj <acronym> URL </acronym> u "
"&konqueror;  ili pokrenuti <userinput> <command> khelpcenter </command> "
"<parameter> help:/kig </parameter> </userinput>)."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kig.1.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is also further information available at the <ulink url=\"http://edu."
"kde.org/kig/\">&kde; Edutainment website</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Tu su i dodatne informacije dostupne na <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig/"
"\">&kde; stranici za zabavu i obrazovanje</ulink>."

